---
title: Shipping & Pickup
description: How Saucy Fields orders get to you — shipping rates, timelines, and local pickup in Winona.
showInFooter: true
---

## Shipping

We ship anywhere in the US at a **flat rate** (set at checkout). Orders usually go
out within a week — pre-sale items ship after the print run is finished, and the
product page will say so.

## Local pickup

If you're in the **Winona area**, pickup is free. Choose the pickup option at
checkout or send us a note and we'll sort out a time or a drop-off.

## Returns

Something wrong with your order? [Email us](/contact) and we'll make it right.
